+// Adapted from PS2Recomp-Fixer's IPU (third_party/fixer-ipu, GPL-3.0), itself derived from PCSX2's IPU (GPL-2.0+/GPL-3.0+)
+// and libmpeg2. This file keeps the original copyright notices; it is distributed under the GPL-3.0 terms.
+// Changes: removed the dodperf profiling include/scope.
+// [DoD] PS2 IPU model. The decoding paths (IDEC, FDEC, SETIQ, SETVQ, SETTH, CSC) follow PCSX2's
+// pcsx2/IPU/IPU.cpp, IPU_MultiISA.cpp, yuv2rgb.cpp and IPUdither.cpp (GPL-2.0+ / GPL-3.0+), which in turn are
+// based on libmpeg2 (Michel Lespinasse, Aaron Holtzman). See ps2_ipu.h for the model.
